WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.390
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.660 --> 01:48.000
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.080 --> 01:50.950
[Episode 2]

4
01:58.289 --> 01:59.280
Ms. Idle Cloud,

5
01:59.430 --> 02:00.360
you're so early.

6
02:00.780 --> 02:01.780
Take a seat first.

7
02:03.070 --> 02:03.870
Jiameng.

8
02:04.390 --> 02:05.720
Have a seat. Here.

9
02:05.870 --> 02:06.400
Okay.

10
02:11.960 --> 02:13.560
Everyone, take a seat first.

11
02:14.060 --> 02:14.710
Let me tell you,

12
02:14.710 --> 02:15.810
I'll ask for your help again

13
02:15.810 --> 02:16.680
for the next test.

14
02:16.680 --> 02:17.750
Sure, no problem.

15
02:23.090 --> 02:24.090
Ms. Idle Cloud,

16
02:24.400 --> 02:26.060
are you looking for someone?

17
02:27.000 --> 02:27.900
N-No.

18
02:50.470 --> 02:51.730
How did you end up here?

19
02:53.130 --> 02:54.000
Come, sit here.

20
02:58.130 --> 02:59.990
I thought you didn't like crowds.

21
03:01.860 --> 03:02.520
I'm hungry.

22
03:04.910 --> 03:06.640
The view here is not bad, right?

23
03:08.060 --> 03:10.060
When Mr. Xu and Shize sit together,

24
03:10.120 --> 03:13.050
it's a total paradise for people who love good looks.

25
03:17.870 --> 03:19.810
What does Shize do

26
03:19.810 --> 03:21.280
at EAW?

27
03:21.810 --> 03:23.180
He's a friend of Mr. Xu

28
03:23.280 --> 03:25.540
who came over to help before the opening.

29
03:26.020 --> 03:27.620
He is very handsome,

30
03:27.810 --> 03:29.060
but he's too cold.

31
03:29.190 --> 03:30.920
I don't even dare to talk to him.

32
03:40.190 --> 03:41.370
Hello, everyone!

33
03:41.690 --> 03:42.750
Everyone's here?

34
03:44.260 --> 03:45.440
Who is this?

35
03:45.470 --> 03:46.290
Ms. Feifei,

36
03:46.320 --> 03:47.290
you're dressed so extravagantly.

37
03:47.290 --> 03:48.560
You're stealing the show!

38
03:48.560 --> 03:50.090
Mr. K, don't talk nonsense.

39
03:50.470 --> 03:51.130
Take a seat.

40
03:52.900 --> 03:53.690
Handsome,

41
03:53.960 --> 03:55.180
this seat is empty.

42
03:55.180 --> 03:56.620
Do you mind if I sit here?

43
03:56.960 --> 03:57.750
I do.

44
03:59.670 --> 04:01.130
It's fine. Just sit there.

45
04:09.520 --> 04:10.310
Handsome,

46
04:10.870 --> 04:12.460
are you Mr. Xu's friend?

47
04:12.460 --> 04:13.470
You flew the drone

48
04:13.470 --> 04:14.960
so well today.

49
04:15.650 --> 04:17.579
Can you teach me when you have time?

50
04:21.100 --> 04:22.510
This social butterfly.

51
04:22.690 --> 04:23.890
She went after Mr. Xu during the day,

52
04:23.890 --> 04:25.860
and now she's targeting someone else.

53
04:25.860 --> 04:27.390
I realized I haven't introduced myself yet.

54
04:27.390 --> 04:28.750
I'm Fairy Feifei.

55
04:28.800 --> 04:30.220
Just call me Feifei.

56
04:42.180 --> 04:44.010
Cheers! Come on, cheers.

57
05:27.890 --> 05:29.020
You want to eat this?

58
05:29.430 --> 05:30.560
Let me get it for you.

59
05:31.040 --> 05:31.620
No need.

60
05:35.600 --> 05:37.430
Was he turning the table for me?

61
05:49.060 --> 05:49.620
Come!

62
05:49.620 --> 05:50.880
Let me propose a toast.

63
05:50.920 --> 05:52.720
Everyone has worked hard today.

64
05:52.980 --> 05:54.810
Thank you, Mr. Xu.

65
05:54.810 --> 05:55.830
Good job.

66
06:00.830 --> 06:01.630
I wonder if anyone

67
06:01.630 --> 06:02.430
has any suggestions

68
06:02.430 --> 06:03.630
for EAW?

69
06:03.920 --> 06:05.480
Before the official opening,

70
06:05.480 --> 06:06.420
is there anything

71
06:06.420 --> 06:07.820
that needs improvement?

72
06:08.030 --> 06:10.310
Please speak freely.

73
06:10.630 --> 06:12.420
There's nothing to improve.

74
06:12.540 --> 06:13.810
It's already the best.

75
06:14.630 --> 06:16.680
Only EAW could reach

76
06:16.720 --> 06:17.130
such high standards

77
06:17.130 --> 06:18.570
within the country.

78
06:19.130 --> 06:20.330
How else to improve, isn't it?

79
06:20.330 --> 06:21.510
Mr. K is right.

80
06:21.580 --> 06:23.100
EAW is the best.

81
06:23.240 --> 06:23.980
We really

82
06:23.980 --> 06:25.910
broadened our horizons this time.

83
06:25.920 --> 06:27.070
Ms. Idle Cloud,

84
06:27.810 --> 06:29.870
why haven't you talked much tonight?

85
06:30.190 --> 06:30.990
Feifei.

86
06:31.770 --> 06:33.100
Ms. Idle Cloud

87
06:33.130 --> 06:34.770
is very introverted,

88
06:35.310 --> 06:37.310
so stop making it difficult for her.

89
06:37.540 --> 06:38.920
How are you a content creator

90
06:38.920 --> 06:40.310
when you are this introverted?

91
06:40.310 --> 06:41.440
Just say a few words.

92
06:41.620 --> 06:42.870
We're not going to eat you,

93
06:42.870 --> 06:43.430
right?

94
06:43.430 --> 06:44.180
Yeah, yeah.

95
06:44.310 --> 06:45.270
That's right.

96
06:48.190 --> 06:50.070
It's clearly a normal word.

97
06:50.570 --> 06:51.720
How did it become

98
06:51.750 --> 06:53.250
a derogatory term?

99
06:53.640 --> 06:54.840
Ms. Idle Cloud,

100
06:55.050 --> 06:57.450
it is indeed not good to be too introverted.

101
06:57.940 --> 06:58.800
I feel that

102
06:58.830 --> 07:01.560
introversion is just a personal trait,

103
07:01.920 --> 07:03.040
not a flaw.

104
07:04.260 --> 07:05.080
This...

105
07:05.310 --> 07:06.870
Ms. Idle Cloud Tick-Tock

106
07:07.310 --> 07:08.430
thought for so long

107
07:08.510 --> 07:10.240
just to say this one sentence?

108
07:13.810 --> 07:16.140
Introverted people are good at thinking.

109
07:17.630 --> 07:18.830
At least they don't talk nonsense

110
07:18.830 --> 07:19.920
without thinking.

111
07:25.220 --> 07:26.010
Well,

112
07:26.810 --> 07:29.410
that can't be considered an advantage, right?

113
07:42.070 --> 07:42.920
It's still early.

114
07:42.920 --> 07:43.540
Why don't we

115
07:43.540 --> 07:44.810
play a game together?

116
07:45.010 --> 07:47.200
Why do we still have to play games?

117
07:47.220 --> 07:48.820
Let's play the simplest one.

118
07:48.980 --> 07:50.420
Exchanging whispers.

119
07:50.770 --> 07:52.830
The same phrase is passed down from

120
07:52.830 --> 07:54.240
the first person in turn,

121
07:54.620 --> 07:56.010
but you must keep your voice down

122
07:56.010 --> 07:58.010
so that a third person can't hear it.

123
07:59.810 --> 08:02.070
Then let's start counterclockwise.

124
08:02.730 --> 08:03.860
Counterclockwise?

125
08:04.310 --> 08:05.370
That means

126
08:05.620 --> 08:07.220
I have to pass it to my left...

127
08:11.940 --> 08:13.070
Counterclockwise?

128
08:13.920 --> 08:14.720
Sorry,

129
08:15.070 --> 08:16.200
can we switch seats?

130
08:19.930 --> 08:20.920
I am having a cold,

131
08:20.920 --> 08:22.040
but the air vent is right over there.

132
08:22.040 --> 08:23.300
I'm feeling a bit cold.

133
08:23.350 --> 08:25.180
He is not yet recovered from his cold?

134
08:25.180 --> 08:27.140
Why... is he switching seats?

135
08:28.540 --> 08:29.350
That's fine.

136
08:29.510 --> 08:30.310
Thank you.

137
08:47.530 --> 08:48.130
Well...

138
08:51.550 --> 08:52.030
I...

139
08:54.580 --> 08:55.720
If I ask him

140
08:55.720 --> 08:57.520
if he can hear from his right ear,

141
08:57.530 --> 08:59.060
would it be too deliberate?

142
09:00.000 --> 09:01.460
Never mind. It's nothing.

143
09:25.550 --> 09:26.280
Come closer.

144
09:30.500 --> 09:31.290
Move closer.

145
10:14.150 --> 10:15.220
So when we played

146
10:15.220 --> 10:16.600
Wings of the Sky today,

147
10:17.010 --> 10:18.150
he already noticed

148
10:18.150 --> 10:20.210
that I couldn't hear with my left ear.

149
10:45.740 --> 10:46.890
That was one

150
10:46.890 --> 10:48.480
nerve-racking meal.

151
11:04.340 --> 11:05.030
Hello.

152
11:05.030 --> 11:06.980
Can I add you on WeChat?

153
11:15.000 --> 11:15.930
What did you say?

154
11:16.720 --> 11:19.290
I...

155
11:21.790 --> 11:24.000
Thank you for speaking up for me

156
11:24.000 --> 11:25.200
at the table just now.

157
11:28.270 --> 11:29.200
You're welcome.

158
11:34.790 --> 11:35.600
You asked me

159
11:36.480 --> 11:37.740
to come closer just now

160
11:37.840 --> 11:39.170
because you knew I...

161
11:41.530 --> 11:43.330
Why aren't you saying anything?

162
11:43.530 --> 11:44.590
You didn't finish.

163
11:47.510 --> 11:48.440
I wanted to ask,

164
11:48.440 --> 11:49.480
w-why did you

165
11:49.480 --> 11:50.740
tell me to come closer?

166
11:54.010 --> 11:54.620
The rules.

167
11:56.890 --> 11:58.820
We can't let a third person hear us.

168
12:04.220 --> 12:05.010
Shize.

169
12:05.720 --> 12:06.580
Shall we go?

170
12:10.360 --> 12:11.760
If there's nothing else,

171
12:12.270 --> 12:13.470
I'll head over first.

172
13:03.980 --> 13:04.720
Lili.

173
13:04.720 --> 13:05.480
How was it?

174
13:05.480 --> 13:06.610
Did it go well today?

175
13:07.210 --> 13:08.520
It went pretty well.

176
13:08.720 --> 13:09.510
That's good.

177
13:10.010 --> 13:10.820
Tangy.

178
13:11.220 --> 13:12.820
Do you remember

179
13:13.340 --> 13:15.010
when I was in high school,

180
13:15.010 --> 13:16.540
I mentioned someone to you?

181
13:17.120 --> 13:17.910
Who is it?

182
13:18.130 --> 13:19.030
Aren't you just on average terms

183
13:19.030 --> 13:20.960
with your high school classmates?

184
13:21.220 --> 13:22.670
He's not a high school classmate.

185
13:22.670 --> 13:23.440
He's the one

186
13:24.120 --> 13:25.140
from XUST.

187
13:29.720 --> 13:31.580
Is he the one whom you described as

188
13:31.580 --> 13:32.410
radiant,

189
13:32.580 --> 13:33.630
full of vitality,

190
13:33.670 --> 13:34.740
embodying both talent and looks,

191
13:34.740 --> 13:36.140
and is like a moon in your heart?

192
13:36.140 --> 13:37.270
You even enshrined his photo

193
13:37.270 --> 13:38.930
and almost lighted incense for him.

194
13:38.930 --> 13:39.870
Alright,

195
13:39.890 --> 13:40.820
say no more.

196
13:41.820 --> 13:43.280
Why bring him up suddenly?

197
13:43.820 --> 13:46.050
I saw him.

198
13:46.440 --> 13:47.580
Really?

199
13:47.820 --> 13:48.620
Where?

200
13:48.620 --> 13:49.440
In Nanwu?

201
13:50.630 --> 13:52.270
He's the

202
13:52.270 --> 13:54.130
Umbrella Killer I told you about.

203
13:54.740 --> 13:55.840
It's him!

204
13:57.270 --> 13:58.670
But...

205
13:58.740 --> 14:00.220
I feel like he's

206
14:00.220 --> 14:01.750
a bit different now.

207
14:03.270 --> 14:05.240
But exactly what's different?

208
14:05.620 --> 14:06.290
I...

209
14:06.320 --> 14:07.190
Hold on.

210
14:07.370 --> 14:08.370
Don't say it now.

211
14:08.370 --> 14:09.600
Wait until I get to Nanwu tomorrow,

212
14:09.600 --> 14:11.030
then we can have a good chat.

213
14:11.030 --> 14:12.370
I want to say it now—

214
14:15.580 --> 14:17.370
You never let me finish.

215
14:30.260 --> 14:31.930
[Child prodigy skips grades and tops the college entrance exam in Nanwu]

216
14:41.580 --> 14:43.220
How is he different?

217
14:47.510 --> 14:48.370
Forget it.

218
14:48.670 --> 14:49.480
Go to sleep.

219
15:02.550 --> 15:04.220
[EAW, Ms. He]

220
15:07.410 --> 15:08.220
Hello.

221
15:08.940 --> 15:09.870
Ms. Idle Cloud,

222
15:10.010 --> 15:11.080
I would like to ask

223
15:11.080 --> 15:12.440
when you are returning

224
15:12.440 --> 15:14.080
so we can book a ticket for you.

225
15:14.080 --> 15:15.080
No need to book.

226
15:15.080 --> 15:17.340
I won't be returning to Xifu anytime soon.

227
15:17.340 --> 15:19.740
In that case, I'll extend your stay for another week.

228
15:19.740 --> 15:20.720
Thank you guys.

229
15:21.310 --> 15:22.110
Thanks.

230
15:32.870 --> 15:35.530
That saves me a week's rent.

231
15:38.080 --> 15:38.910
That's great.

232
16:00.960 --> 16:01.700
You brat!

233
16:02.080 --> 16:03.220
don't you have eyes?

234
16:03.220 --> 16:03.720
This is a sidewalk.

235
16:03.720 --> 16:04.580
Can't you see it?

236
16:04.580 --> 16:05.410
You were driving so fast!

237
16:05.410 --> 16:06.940
Who's the one without eyes?

238
16:07.900 --> 16:09.850
What? "Driving"?

239
16:09.880 --> 16:11.080
This isn't even a car!

240
16:11.120 --> 16:13.180
How is it not a car when it has 4 wheels?

241
16:14.620 --> 16:15.680
You call this a car?

242
16:17.080 --> 16:17.720
Old Auntie.

243
16:17.720 --> 16:19.980
I really don't have time to mess with you.

244
16:21.980 --> 16:22.770
Old Auntie?

245
16:23.500 --> 16:25.160
Who are you calling an auntie?

246
16:25.940 --> 16:27.400
Is there anyone else here?

247
16:30.720 --> 16:31.320
Old Auntie,

248
16:31.320 --> 16:32.370
maybe you're getting old

249
16:32.370 --> 16:33.770
and your aim is getting worse.

250
16:33.770 --> 16:35.130
Remember to throw more accurately the next time.

251
16:35.130 --> 16:35.700
Bye!

252
16:36.630 --> 16:38.360
Don't let me run into you again!

253
16:39.520 --> 16:41.040
I am so scared, Old Auntie.

254
17:09.089 --> 17:09.660
Tangy!

255
17:09.660 --> 17:10.550
Lili!

256
17:11.200 --> 17:12.700
I missed you so much.

257
17:13.270 --> 17:14.109
It's been so long,

258
17:14.109 --> 17:15.440
and we finally meet again.

259
17:15.440 --> 17:16.609
You brought something?

260
17:16.609 --> 17:18.180
I brought you some fresh peaches.

261
17:18.180 --> 17:18.680
Really?

262
17:18.680 --> 17:20.510
I was just craving some fruit.

263
17:20.740 --> 17:22.470
Thanks for the food, my friend.

264
17:25.400 --> 17:26.180
But my friend,

265
17:26.180 --> 17:27.940
these are fresh peaches?

266
17:29.570 --> 17:31.230
Speaking of this makes me mad.

267
17:31.400 --> 17:33.130
I just ran into this brat

268
17:33.330 --> 17:34.510
riding his stupid skateboard,

269
17:34.510 --> 17:35.330
bumping into things left and right.

270
17:35.330 --> 17:36.310
He knocked all my peaches

271
17:36.310 --> 17:37.330
to the ground.

272
17:37.330 --> 17:38.810
It took me forever to pick them up.

273
17:38.810 --> 17:39.460
It's okay.

274
17:39.740 --> 17:41.270
At least they're still edible.

275
17:41.270 --> 17:42.440
I told him off

276
17:42.440 --> 17:43.640
and he got mad instead.

277
17:43.640 --> 17:45.070
Do you know what he called me?

278
17:45.070 --> 17:45.740
What?

279
17:45.740 --> 17:46.880
Old Auntie.

280
17:49.640 --> 17:51.070
I'm in my prime

281
17:51.070 --> 17:53.070
and shining with my natural beauty.

282
17:53.420 --> 17:55.240
Which eye of his saw that I was old?

283
17:55.240 --> 17:56.330
Don't lower yourself

284
17:56.330 --> 17:56.830
to that brat's level.

285
17:56.830 --> 17:58.660
Our Tangy is the most beautiful in the world.

286
17:58.660 --> 17:59.990
Number one in the world.

287
18:00.940 --> 18:01.640
Let's not talk about him.

288
18:01.640 --> 18:02.770
What bad luck.

289
18:03.770 --> 18:04.720
Have you had breakfast?

290
18:04.720 --> 18:05.420
No.

291
18:05.880 --> 18:06.680
Let's go.

292
18:06.920 --> 18:07.810
And tell me more about

293
18:07.810 --> 18:09.330
your first love.

294
18:13.440 --> 18:15.030
I remember it was almost the senior year,

295
18:15.030 --> 18:17.180
yet you would still go to XUST every day.

296
18:17.180 --> 18:18.000
I originally thought

297
18:18.000 --> 18:20.090
you'd neglect your studies for a handsome guy.

298
18:20.090 --> 18:20.530
I didn't expect you

299
18:20.530 --> 18:22.030
to make him your goal,

300
18:22.380 --> 18:24.000
and you worked so hard then.

301
18:25.550 --> 18:27.180
The day you failed the exam,

302
18:27.180 --> 18:28.510
you cried your eyes out.

303
18:28.830 --> 18:29.200
After that,

304
18:29.200 --> 18:30.830
I never heard you mention him again.

305
18:30.830 --> 18:32.500
It's really meant to be

306
18:32.500 --> 18:34.360
if you could meet again like this.

307
18:35.740 --> 18:36.700
I didn't expect

308
18:37.380 --> 18:38.770
to meet him again either,

309
18:38.770 --> 18:41.180
and of all places, in Nanwu.

310
18:43.330 --> 18:44.240
Shouldn't he be

311
18:44.240 --> 18:45.590
doing his Ph.D. at XUST now?

312
18:45.590 --> 18:46.070
Why is he at

313
18:46.070 --> 18:47.000
EAW?

314
18:47.900 --> 18:49.000
If we calculate the time,

315
18:49.000 --> 18:50.930
he probably hasn't graduated yet.

316
18:51.500 --> 18:53.380
I'm wondering about this too.

317
18:54.700 --> 18:55.940
We don't need to dwell on it.

318
18:55.940 --> 18:57.940
Why don't you just ask him directly?

319
19:00.160 --> 19:00.960
I...

320
19:02.740 --> 19:03.240
Well...

321
19:05.310 --> 19:06.710
Did you add him on WeChat?

322
19:08.830 --> 19:09.440
No.

323
19:09.740 --> 19:10.880
Don't tell me you don't even have

324
19:10.880 --> 19:12.770
the courage to ask for his WeChat.

325
19:15.250 --> 19:16.150
Just eat.

326
19:24.830 --> 19:25.330
Lili,

327
19:26.180 --> 19:27.480
do you plan to let it all go

328
19:27.480 --> 19:28.830
without a trace,

329
19:28.830 --> 19:30.070
and let it drift away

330
19:30.070 --> 19:31.110
like smoke in the wind?

331
19:31.110 --> 19:32.880
What else can I do?

332
19:33.380 --> 19:34.830
Then try a little harder.

333
19:36.070 --> 19:37.010
How?

334
19:40.440 --> 19:40.850
Find a day

335
19:40.850 --> 19:42.180
to go wander around EAW.

336
19:42.220 --> 19:44.220
Show up discreetly

337
19:44.220 --> 19:45.950
and create a chance encounter.

338
19:46.570 --> 19:47.460
But he simply

339
19:47.460 --> 19:48.180
went to EAW

340
19:48.180 --> 19:49.220
to help out temporarily.

341
19:49.220 --> 19:50.810
I am guessing he won't stay that long.

342
19:50.810 --> 19:52.530
Anyway, let me tell you.

343
19:52.630 --> 19:54.900
You have to fight for your own happiness.

344
19:59.010 --> 19:59.640
Today,

345
19:59.640 --> 20:01.270
I really wanted to accompany you.

346
20:01.270 --> 20:03.220
But I've already promised Xia.

347
20:03.220 --> 20:04.240
Her homestay is opening,

348
20:04.240 --> 20:05.310
and I have to go help.

349
20:05.310 --> 20:05.980
It's fine.

350
20:05.980 --> 20:07.510
I have to go back and edit a video anyway.

351
20:07.510 --> 20:08.110
It's okay.

352
20:08.940 --> 20:09.610
When you're less busy,

353
20:09.610 --> 20:11.030
let's stay at the homestay together.

354
20:11.030 --> 20:12.310
Xia is really nice.

355
20:12.310 --> 20:14.570
You two will definitely be good friends.

356
20:16.370 --> 20:17.000
Okay.

357
20:17.000 --> 20:18.070
Hurry up and go do your thing.

358
20:18.070 --> 20:18.480
You...

359
20:21.010 --> 20:21.460
Okay.

360
20:21.460 --> 20:22.860
Go keep your Xia company.

361
20:23.330 --> 20:25.130
Tell me if there's any progress.

362
20:27.070 --> 20:27.920
Got it.

363
20:29.770 --> 20:30.940
You can't live on air.

364
20:30.940 --> 20:33.070
Remember to eat no matter how busy you are.

365
20:33.070 --> 20:33.880
I know.

366
20:34.110 --> 20:34.720
Bye.

367
20:34.720 --> 20:35.420
Bye.

368
20:37.810 --> 20:39.070
Be careful not to fall.

369
20:39.830 --> 20:40.570
If you still don't leave,

370
20:40.570 --> 20:41.740
you'll have to help me edit the video.

371
20:41.740 --> 20:42.400
Bye.

372
20:58.680 --> 20:59.680
I'm done editing!

373
21:05.140 --> 21:07.030
There's just one thing left to do.

374
21:16.830 --> 21:18.160
I'll go with this store.

375
21:22.590 --> 21:23.640
No delivery?

376
21:24.180 --> 21:26.030
How far is it from here?

377
21:27.680 --> 21:28.890
3km?

378
21:33.030 --> 21:34.360
The cab is so expensive!

379
21:35.300 --> 21:37.630
I could have a few more servings with that.

380
21:37.940 --> 21:38.610
Never mind.

381
21:43.290 --> 21:44.070
I'll just walk there.

382
21:44.070 --> 21:45.330
Consider it a workout.

383
21:50.500 --> 21:52.400
Something doesn't feel right.

384
21:55.070 --> 21:56.880
I want to drink some more!

385
21:56.880 --> 21:58.010
I'm not drunk!

386
21:58.380 --> 21:59.180
Stop drinking!

387
21:59.180 --> 21:59.740
Go home now.

388
21:59.740 --> 22:00.500
No, I don't want!

389
22:00.500 --> 22:01.330
I still want to drink!

390
22:01.330 --> 22:02.110
Look how much you've had.

391
22:02.110 --> 22:03.460
I'm not drunk!

392
22:04.830 --> 22:05.310
Sorry.

393
22:05.310 --> 22:05.960
Hey, pretty girl.

394
22:05.960 --> 22:07.340
You almost bumped into me.

395
22:07.340 --> 22:08.880
And all you have to say is sorry?

396
22:08.880 --> 22:10.140
Where are you heading?

397
22:12.700 --> 22:14.100
Why are you running away?

398
22:16.700 --> 22:17.880
Dafeng, Dafeng.

399
22:17.880 --> 22:19.590
Don't scare the pretty girl.

400
22:19.730 --> 22:20.840
I'm just saying hi.

401
22:22.000 --> 22:22.790
Pretty girl.

402
22:24.090 --> 22:25.200
Did I scare you?

403
22:25.440 --> 22:26.830
Wanna grab supper with me?

404
22:26.830 --> 22:27.700
My treat.

405
22:28.090 --> 22:29.350
Come with me, will you?

406
22:29.460 --> 22:31.320
My boyfriend is here to pick me up.

407
22:32.810 --> 22:34.510
You have no game at all.

408
22:34.510 --> 22:35.160
Fu Shizhe.

409
22:42.050 --> 22:43.180
What a coincidence.

410
22:43.700 --> 22:44.330
Shize.

411
22:44.830 --> 22:45.750
Is this your...

412
22:46.000 --> 22:47.060
What are you doing?

413
22:47.130 --> 22:49.350
I just wanted to treat her to supper.

414
22:51.530 --> 22:52.460
Do you want to go?

415
22:55.530 --> 22:56.590
You've scared her.

416
22:56.850 --> 22:57.660
Apologize.

417
22:59.160 --> 22:59.750
Okay.

418
22:59.750 --> 23:00.750
I will.

419
23:01.140 --> 23:02.160
My bad.

420
23:05.850 --> 23:06.790
Say it again.

421
23:10.850 --> 23:11.640
My bad.

422
23:13.590 --> 23:14.240
Apologize properly.

423
23:14.240 --> 23:15.500
What are you sorry for?

424
23:16.140 --> 23:16.790
Dafeng.

425
23:23.050 --> 23:23.830
I'm sorry!

426
23:27.210 --> 23:28.020
Shize,

427
23:28.750 --> 23:30.350
Dafeng had too much to drink.

428
23:30.500 --> 23:31.350
Uh, sister-in-law,

429
23:31.350 --> 23:32.090
we're sorry.

430
23:32.090 --> 23:33.350
Don't take it to heart.

431
23:34.240 --> 23:35.200
I'll... I'll take him

432
23:35.200 --> 23:36.250
to sober up immediately.

433
23:36.250 --> 23:37.330
Let's go.

434
23:39.380 --> 23:40.080
He's drunk.

435
23:49.350 --> 23:50.200
Thank you.

436
23:52.240 --> 23:53.640
What did you just call me?

437
23:59.310 --> 24:00.500
Fu Shizhe. Fu...

438
24:02.250 --> 24:03.050
Fu Shize.

439
24:06.270 --> 24:07.720
Fu Shizhe.

440
24:09.900 --> 24:11.050
Straighten your tongue.

441
24:11.050 --> 24:11.850
Say it again.

442
24:14.410 --> 24:16.610
Fu Shize.

443
24:18.750 --> 24:19.400
Sorry.

444
24:19.400 --> 24:20.400
I-I didn't mean to

445
24:20.400 --> 24:21.750
get your name wrong.

446
24:22.400 --> 24:23.850
Whenever I'm nervous, I

447
24:24.160 --> 24:25.830
can't pronounce things properly.

448
24:25.830 --> 24:27.090
How do you know my name?

449
24:28.330 --> 24:30.590
Someone at EAW said it.

450
24:36.200 --> 24:37.530
What are you doing here?

451
24:37.700 --> 24:38.500
I...

452
24:39.750 --> 24:41.550
I came to buy fried rice noodles.

453
24:44.140 --> 24:46.570
But I think I'm lost.

454
24:49.700 --> 24:51.360
The app says it's around here,

455
24:51.500 --> 24:52.500
but I don't see it.

456
24:54.700 --> 24:55.230
Let's go.

457
25:00.830 --> 25:03.030
I'll take you to get fried rice noodles.

458
25:19.400 --> 25:20.940
Can I add you on...

459
25:25.720 --> 25:27.780
Let me treat you to some rice noodles.

460
25:30.810 --> 25:31.470
No, thanks.

461
25:33.980 --> 25:35.110
Then, can I add you on...

462
25:35.110 --> 25:36.710
Miss, what do you want to add?

463
25:37.570 --> 25:38.330
We have eggs

464
25:38.330 --> 25:39.110
and sausages.

465
25:39.110 --> 25:40.310
You can add anything.

466
25:43.570 --> 25:44.440
Nothing,

467
25:44.530 --> 25:45.160
thanks.

468
25:53.720 --> 25:55.450
I hope those two people earlier

469
25:55.880 --> 25:56.940
didn't bother you.

470
25:59.380 --> 26:00.180
It's fine.

471
26:02.770 --> 26:03.740
Go home early.

472
26:06.200 --> 26:06.640
Okay.

473
26:09.250 --> 26:10.250
Fu Shize, I...

474
26:12.030 --> 26:14.130
Can I ask you a question?

475
26:17.460 --> 26:18.030
Go ahead.

476
26:21.310 --> 26:22.810
How does VR

477
26:22.810 --> 26:24.940
create such an immersive experience?

478
26:25.680 --> 26:27.110
The screen is so close,

479
26:27.640 --> 26:29.270
yet it feels so real.

480
26:38.270 --> 26:39.400
Close your left eye.

481
26:42.270 --> 26:43.870
Now switch to your right eye.

482
26:47.140 --> 26:48.220
Is there a difference?

483
26:48.220 --> 26:50.880
P-Perceptual difference?

484
26:52.980 --> 26:55.010
So, the sense of distance in VR

485
26:55.010 --> 26:57.470
is actually a carefully designed illusion.

486
26:58.070 --> 26:59.030
You can say that.

487
27:00.140 --> 27:01.670
Although it's an illusion,

488
27:02.110 --> 27:02.880
your brain will think

489
27:02.880 --> 27:04.210
it's a real experience.

490
27:07.110 --> 27:07.940
Fu Shize.

491
27:09.350 --> 27:10.250
Thank you.

492
27:12.830 --> 27:13.830
Is that all?

493
27:18.740 --> 27:19.940
C-Can I

494
27:19.940 --> 27:21.570
get your contact info?

495
27:25.310 --> 27:27.270
I-I know you have a cold.

496
27:27.880 --> 27:30.170
I heard there's a very effective medicine,

497
27:30.170 --> 27:31.970
and I want to recommend it to you.

498
27:34.310 --> 27:34.970
No, thanks.

499
27:36.000 --> 27:36.510
Never mind then.

500
27:36.510 --> 27:38.240
I-I wish you a speedy recovery.

501
28:04.330 --> 28:06.770
Yun Li, what are you doing?

502
28:09.680 --> 28:11.420
So embarrassing.

503
28:11.420 --> 28:12.750
So embarrassing.

504
28:16.480 --> 28:17.350
Memory erased.

505
28:17.350 --> 28:18.980
Nothing happened just now.

506
28:19.070 --> 28:20.220
Nothing happened.

507
28:26.920 --> 28:27.770
Let's ask Tang Lin.

508
28:27.770 --> 28:28.980
She might know.

509
28:30.050 --> 28:30.660
No.

510
28:31.070 --> 28:32.070
If I tell Tang Lin,

511
28:32.070 --> 28:33.420
won't everyone know?

512
28:34.320 --> 28:36.530
I'll... I'll ask Yun Ye.

513
28:37.180 --> 28:38.160
Definitely not Yun Ye.

514
28:38.160 --> 28:38.980
He's just a kid.

515
28:38.980 --> 28:39.980
What does he know?

516
28:42.400 --> 28:43.460
Ask my fans.

517
28:46.480 --> 28:49.660
The fewer people know about this, the better.

518
28:50.940 --> 28:52.100
I'll ask Baidu.

519
28:53.680 --> 28:55.300
[Being rejected when asking someone for their WeChat]

520
28:58.270 --> 28:59.010
Was it because

521
28:59.010 --> 29:00.720
my way of asking for his WeChat was wrong,

522
29:00.720 --> 29:02.450
and I didn't make myself clear?

523
29:02.750 --> 29:05.480
I did make myself clear, didn't I?

524
29:06.610 --> 29:07.380
No.

525
29:07.380 --> 29:08.980
This answer is unreliable.

526
29:10.160 --> 29:11.420
He's just pretending.

527
29:11.570 --> 29:12.700
Playing hard to get.

528
29:12.960 --> 29:15.660
Ask a few more times and he'll give it to you.

529
29:16.350 --> 29:17.480
Playing hard to get?

530
29:20.050 --> 29:21.650
He's not that kind of person.

531
29:22.850 --> 29:24.350
Isn't it obvious?

532
29:24.350 --> 29:25.510
It means he's

533
29:25.770 --> 29:28.070
not interested in you at all.

534
29:29.380 --> 29:32.050
That's possible.

535
29:34.810 --> 29:36.410
I didn't even get his WeChat.

536
29:37.510 --> 29:38.770
I don't know when

537
29:38.770 --> 29:41.090
I'll see him again.

538
29:44.350 --> 29:45.510
It's fine.

539
29:45.610 --> 29:47.380
We still have the noodles.

540
29:54.920 --> 29:55.810
It's cold.

541
29:56.070 --> 29:57.220
It's stone cold.

542
29:57.920 --> 29:59.850
My heart is even colder than yours.

543
30:11.250 --> 30:13.460
The missing person has finally returned!

544
30:13.460 --> 30:13.940
Grandpa,

545
30:13.940 --> 30:14.660
the content creator you follow

546
30:14.660 --> 30:15.640
is finally online!

547
30:15.640 --> 30:16.850
Update already! Update already!

548
30:16.850 --> 30:18.220
Where is the promised benefit

549
30:18.220 --> 30:18.940
when you hit a million fans?

550
30:18.940 --> 30:19.980
When are you updating next?

551
30:19.980 --> 30:21.200
I'm new here. I'll come every time from now on.

552
30:21.200 --> 30:22.140
Start a livestream quickly. I can't wait!

553
30:22.140 --> 30:23.460
When will you chat with us?

554
30:23.460 --> 30:24.610
First time here, please take care of me.

555
30:24.610 --> 30:25.850
Hello, everyone.

556
30:25.850 --> 30:28.070
I'm Idle Cloud Tick-Tock.

557
30:28.510 --> 30:29.900
Idle Cloud is finally online!

558
30:29.900 --> 30:31.140
I missed you so much.

559
30:31.140 --> 30:32.700
This is the benefit I promised all of you

560
30:32.700 --> 30:34.300
when we reach a million fans.

561
30:35.200 --> 30:36.880
Why did I change my avatar?

562
30:40.050 --> 30:42.310
Because I'm feeling a bit "zhi bi" today.

563
30:42.830 --> 30:43.820
It's "zi bi",

564
30:43.840 --> 30:45.110
not "zhi bi".

565
30:48.820 --> 30:49.960
Straighten your tongue

566
30:49.960 --> 30:50.890
and say it again.

567
30:52.090 --> 30:53.290
"Zi bi" (withdrawn).

568
30:53.750 --> 30:55.880
I didn't say it wrong this time, right?

569
30:56.050 --> 30:56.710
Idle Cloud,

570
30:56.710 --> 30:57.660
how about playing a game?

571
30:57.660 --> 30:59.590
It's boring to just talk like this.

572
30:59.590 --> 31:00.740
That's true.

573
31:01.240 --> 31:03.350
So what should I play?

574
31:03.380 --> 31:04.910
How about tongue twisters?

575
31:05.510 --> 31:06.790
Okay, tongue twisters it is.

576
31:06.790 --> 31:09.450
You guys give me the twisters and I'll read them.

577
31:12.250 --> 31:13.420
Isn't this Ms. Idle Cloud?

578
31:13.420 --> 31:15.930
Grandma Liu looks for Grandma Niu

579
31:15.960 --> 31:18.790
to buy durian milk.

580
31:19.610 --> 31:20.500
Next.

581
31:20.960 --> 31:22.290
4 is 4,

582
31:22.290 --> 31:23.610
10 is 10.

583
31:23.850 --> 31:26.160
40 is a fact,

584
31:26.200 --> 31:27.160
and a fact is...

585
31:30.430 --> 31:32.680
Why are you all laughing?

586
31:33.350 --> 31:35.550
I don't distinguish between flat and retroflex consonants?

587
31:35.550 --> 31:36.680
It's okay, isn't it?

588
31:37.420 --> 31:38.950
Did I read it wrong just now?

589
31:39.960 --> 31:41.720
I didn't expect Ms. Idle Cloud

590
31:42.310 --> 31:43.550
to be quite introverted in private,

591
31:43.550 --> 31:45.550
yet rather extroverted when streaming.

592
31:45.550 --> 31:46.440
Ms. Idle Cloud,

593
31:46.730 --> 31:48.490
make a sentence with "shize".

594
31:48.520 --> 31:50.390
In... in fact...

595
31:51.750 --> 31:53.480
In... in fact...

596
31:53.480 --> 31:55.310
It might look like a wolf,

597
31:55.750 --> 31:57.550
but in fact, it is actually a dog.

598
31:59.610 --> 32:00.740
She's scolding you.

599
32:01.070 --> 32:02.350
She said you're a dog.

600
32:05.810 --> 32:06.610
Boring.

601
32:08.200 --> 32:09.220
This Ms. Idle Cloud is too funny.

602
32:09.220 --> 32:10.680
There's no other meaning to what I said.

603
32:10.680 --> 32:12.180
I'm just making a sentence.

604
32:12.180 --> 32:12.750
Alright.

605
32:12.750 --> 32:14.310
That's it for me today.

606
32:15.770 --> 32:17.570
I'm saying goodbye to everyone.

607
32:18.360 --> 32:19.280
She's off.

608
32:20.250 --> 32:21.250
Tell me what's up.

609
32:23.920 --> 32:25.380
Didn't I ask you before?

610
32:25.570 --> 32:26.160
About officially

611
32:26.160 --> 32:27.510
to join EAW.

612
32:27.920 --> 32:29.250
Have you considered it?

613
32:30.220 --> 32:32.020
Didn't we already agree on this?

614
32:32.070 --> 32:34.400
I'll leave after finishing Light Chaser.

615
32:35.110 --> 32:35.920
Yeah.

616
32:37.470 --> 32:38.320
Light Chaser

617
32:38.350 --> 32:40.350
is about to enter the testing phase.

618
32:40.810 --> 32:43.160
But our company just started.

619
32:43.180 --> 32:43.880
Many things

620
32:43.880 --> 32:46.340
still need to get back on track, step by step.

621
32:46.570 --> 32:47.380
So?

622
32:48.070 --> 32:49.270
So I run the company.

623
32:49.270 --> 32:50.510
I'm a professional.

624
32:51.250 --> 32:52.160
But when it comes to technology,

625
32:52.160 --> 32:53.480
I don't know anything.

626
32:53.720 --> 32:54.810
I need one of my own

627
32:54.810 --> 32:56.140
to keep an eye on things.

628
33:09.460 --> 33:11.060
How is Grandma doing lately?

629
33:11.860 --> 33:13.660
Sometimes good, sometimes bad.

630
33:13.770 --> 33:15.370
Do you still visit her often?

631
33:17.960 --> 33:20.620
Does she still often mistake you for Jiang Yuan?

632
33:24.570 --> 33:25.630
Forget I said that.

633
33:34.500 --> 33:35.290
Then, regarding the digital twin,

634
33:35.290 --> 33:37.550
are you not planning to continue with it?

635
33:39.090 --> 33:39.640
No.

636
33:40.290 --> 33:41.420
Isn't that perfect?

637
33:42.030 --> 33:42.700
During this time,

638
33:42.700 --> 33:44.140
you've seen it at the company.

639
33:44.140 --> 33:45.000
All our equipment

640
33:45.000 --> 33:46.740
is the latest and top-notch.

641
33:46.740 --> 33:47.440
If you work on the digital twin,

642
33:47.440 --> 33:49.000
you can definitely use them.

643
33:49.000 --> 33:49.790
Look.

644
33:50.750 --> 33:51.940
We have the equipment.

645
33:51.940 --> 33:52.880
We have the computing power.

646
33:52.880 --> 33:53.790
As for your conditions,

647
33:53.790 --> 33:55.700
you can use anything in the company.

648
33:55.700 --> 33:56.640
Just stay here with peace of mind

649
33:56.640 --> 33:57.680
and work on your digital twin.

650
33:57.680 --> 33:58.680
When you have time,

651
33:58.680 --> 34:00.810
just help me keep an eye on the company.

652
34:05.790 --> 34:06.920
I'll think about it.

653
34:42.260 --> 34:43.050
Still busy?

654
34:43.840 --> 34:44.500
Yuan!

655
34:45.510 --> 34:46.440
Why are you here?

656
34:47.030 --> 34:47.650
What,

657
34:48.650 --> 34:49.960
can't I come?

658
34:51.120 --> 34:51.929
No,

659
34:51.960 --> 34:52.909
I just thought...

660
34:52.909 --> 34:53.710
Thought what?

661
34:53.960 --> 34:55.630
Thought I'd fall out with you

662
34:55.630 --> 34:56.760
over a project,

663
34:56.800 --> 34:57.840
go our separate ways,

664
34:57.840 --> 34:59.100
and never speak again?

665
34:59.370 --> 35:00.200
No.

666
35:02.500 --> 35:03.300
I know

667
35:04.340 --> 35:06.030
you're afraid I'm under too much pressure

668
35:06.030 --> 35:07.630
and want to share the burden.

669
35:10.900 --> 35:12.030
I've made up my mind.

670
35:13.800 --> 35:14.880
Moving forward,

671
35:15.180 --> 35:16.180
let's work on your

672
35:16.180 --> 35:17.840
smart robotic project first.

673
35:25.950 --> 35:26.510
Yuan,

674
35:26.590 --> 35:28.230
what about your digital twin?

675
35:28.230 --> 35:29.490
We can work on it later.

676
35:29.630 --> 35:30.440
It's the same.

677
35:35.380 --> 35:36.650
You've been working

678
35:36.650 --> 35:37.530
very late again today.

679
35:37.530 --> 35:38.860
You should go to sleep.

680
35:39.180 --> 35:40.430
Go to bed now.

681
35:41.090 --> 35:43.330
[Digital twin is operating normally]

682
35:53.310 --> 35:54.670
[Successfully sent to Idle Cloud Tick-Tock, He Jiameng]

683
35:55.260 --> 35:56.170
Ms. He,

684
35:56.260 --> 35:58.050
I've finished editing the video

685
35:58.050 --> 35:58.860
and sent it to your email.

686
35:58.860 --> 36:00.190
Please check it.

687
36:10.480 --> 36:11.610
I finally found

688
36:11.610 --> 36:13.670
such a cheap and good apartment.

689
36:14.320 --> 36:16.050
Now I have to look for one again.

690
36:18.480 --> 36:21.150
Why are these apartments so expensive?

691
36:22.010 --> 36:23.340
It's over budget again.

692
36:41.600 --> 36:42.710
Hello, Tangy.

693
36:43.130 --> 36:43.840
Lili,

694
36:44.070 --> 36:45.610
what are your plans for today?

695
36:45.610 --> 36:46.760
Apartment hunting.

696
36:47.260 --> 36:48.670
Why are you looking for an apartment?

697
36:48.670 --> 36:49.820
Do you think after that fight

698
36:49.820 --> 36:51.280
with my Dad,

699
36:51.590 --> 36:52.520
if I just go back to Xifu

700
36:52.520 --> 36:54.120
with my tail between my legs,

701
36:54.460 --> 36:55.610
he wouldn't break my legs?

702
36:55.610 --> 36:56.570
He absolutely would,

703
36:56.570 --> 36:58.500
then I won't be able to go anywhere.

704
36:58.920 --> 36:59.670
True.

705
37:00.360 --> 37:01.460
People say

706
37:01.610 --> 37:02.460
daughters are

707
37:02.460 --> 37:04.280
their fathers' lovers in their past lives.

708
37:04.280 --> 37:05.260
I think you must have

709
37:05.260 --> 37:06.920
owed your dad a debt in your past life,

710
37:06.920 --> 37:07.880
and then reincarnated as his daughter

711
37:07.880 --> 37:09.320
to pay it back.

712
37:09.710 --> 37:11.070
Who owes him?

713
37:11.150 --> 37:12.260
But put the apartment search

714
37:12.260 --> 37:13.280
on hold for now.

715
37:13.280 --> 37:14.010
I'll go look with you

716
37:14.010 --> 37:15.340
when I'm free tomorrow.

717
37:15.570 --> 37:16.360
A good friend of mine

718
37:16.360 --> 37:17.050
opened a homestay.

719
37:17.050 --> 37:18.150
Didn't I tell you?

720
37:18.150 --> 37:19.280
It's opening soon.

721
37:20.110 --> 37:21.450
Is it Xia?

722
37:21.650 --> 37:22.380
Yes.

723
37:23.020 --> 37:24.060
I'm going there to help today.

724
37:24.060 --> 37:25.280
Do you want to come with me?

725
37:25.280 --> 37:27.350
I don't know her very well.

726
37:27.380 --> 37:29.040
I don't think it's a good idea.

727
37:29.110 --> 37:30.240
It's fine.

728
37:30.510 --> 37:32.050
Xia is very nice.

729
37:32.050 --> 37:32.650
You'll definitely

730
37:32.650 --> 37:34.310
become good friends with her.

731
37:35.010 --> 37:35.780
Forget it.

732
37:35.780 --> 37:37.480
I won't go.

733
37:37.610 --> 37:39.460
Don't you want to be independent?

734
37:39.460 --> 37:40.010
Isn't it great to have

735
37:40.010 --> 37:41.280
more friends in Nanwu?

736
37:41.670 --> 37:42.980
Rely on your bestie at home,

737
37:42.980 --> 37:44.760
but you have to rely on friends when you are out.

738
37:44.760 --> 37:45.820
It's decided then.

739
37:46.010 --> 37:47.860
That's true.

740
38:01.050 --> 38:02.630
This Xia really...

741
38:02.630 --> 38:03.130
Why is she not coming out

742
38:03.130 --> 38:04.440
to welcome our VIP?

743
38:04.940 --> 38:06.740
Not even laying out a red carpet.

744
38:06.960 --> 38:07.780
Here?

745
38:09.780 --> 38:11.910
Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse?

746
38:13.410 --> 38:16.350
Why does this name sound so familiar?

747
38:16.690 --> 38:17.530
What's wrong?

748
38:18.730 --> 38:19.630
Nothing.

749
38:20.440 --> 38:21.260
Come.

750
38:21.940 --> 38:22.690
Lili,

751
38:22.690 --> 38:24.030
this door is amazing.

752
38:24.030 --> 38:25.300
Let me show you.

753
38:26.630 --> 38:27.830
Puppy, open the door.

754
38:30.050 --> 38:31.590
Puppy, open the door.

755
38:33.230 --> 38:34.860
Has the passphrase been changed?

756
38:34.860 --> 38:35.960
Let me call Xia.

757
38:35.960 --> 38:36.760
You try again.

758
38:38.940 --> 38:39.800
Give it a go.

759
38:42.230 --> 38:43.430
Puppy, open the door.

760
38:43.690 --> 38:44.690
Louder.

761
38:49.300 --> 38:50.170
Puppy—
